,p_escape_mode=>'ATTR'
,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_lov_type=>'STATIC'
,p_help_text=>'Design of the list. avatarRows: people rows with avatar and meta. fileRows: documents with a file-type tile. checklist: tasks with a check box and a Done or Open label. leaderboard: ranked rows with rank number and score bar. contacts: grid of people with presence. settings: grouped inset rows with icon tiles, value and chevron. notifications: tinted rows with state icon. inbox: message rows with sender, preview and time. metricRows: label, value and bar. compact: dense single-line rows. pills: wrapping chips.'
);
